# Enterprise Capability Baseline

Every enterprise frontend application must satisfy capabilities by tier. **Preferred** implementations (including approved versions) are the default; alternatives require ADR per Technology Selection Policy.

## Capability Matrix

| Capability | Tier | Preferred | When required |
|------------|------|-----------|---------------|
| Language | Mandatory | TypeScript 5.7.x (strict mode) | All applications |
| Framework | Mandatory | React 19.0.0 | All applications |
| App framework | Mandatory | Next.js 15.x (App Router, Turbopack) | Default for web applications |
| Package manager | Mandatory | Bun (bun.lock) | All applications |
| Build dev server | Mandatory | Turbopack (`next dev --turbopack`) | Local development |
| Architecture | Mandatory | Feature-based structure | All non-trivial applications |
| Styling | Mandatory | Tailwind CSS 3.4.x + cn() utility | All styling |
| UI components | Mandatory | shadcn/ui (Radix UI + Tailwind) | Base component library |
| Server state | Mandatory | TanStack Query 5.x | All API-backed features |
| Form validation | Mandatory | React Hook Form 7.x + Zod 3.x | All forms with user input |
| API integration | Mandatory | Axios (interceptors via approved API client) | All data access |
| Loading / error UX | Mandatory | Explicit loading and error states | All async operations |
| Authentication | Mandatory | NextAuth (Auth.js) 5.x beta (OIDC / OAuth2) | All protected applications |
| Authorization UX | Mandatory | UI guards (backend enforces security) | Role-gated features |
| Unit / component tests | Mandatory | Vitest or Jest 29.x + React Testing Library 16.x | All features |
| API mocking (tests) | Mandatory | MSW 2.x | All API integration tests |
| Accessibility | Mandatory | WCAG 2.1 Level AA considerations | All user-facing UI |
| Security headers | Mandatory | CSP coordinated with `security-architect` | All production deployments |
| Logging | Mandatory | Client error logging (no secrets) | All production applications |
| Performance awareness | Mandatory | Code splitting, lazy loading, next/image | Applications above trivial size |
| Global state | Conditional | Zustand, Redux Toolkit, or React Context | Shared state across features |
| URL state | Conditional | nuqs 2.x | Query param synchronization |
| E2E testing | Conditional | Playwright (latest stable) | Critical user journeys |
| Internationalization | Conditional | i18n library + translation strategy | Multi-language requirements |
| Bundle budget | Conditional | Defined max bundle size per route/chunk | Performance-sensitive applications |
| Alternative framework | Optional / ADR | Vue, Angular, Svelte | Justified through ADR |
| Alternative app framework | Optional / ADR | Vite, Remix | Justified through ADR |
