# State Management Standard

## Principle

State should remain as local as possible.

Do not introduce global state unnecessarily.

---

## Preferred Order

### Local Component State

Use when possible.

### Feature State

Use when required.

### Global State

Use only when shared across multiple features.

---

## Preferred Global State

Requires project decision.

Examples:

* Redux Toolkit
* Zustand
* Context API

Selection must be documented.

---

