# Escalation Triggers

Escalate when:

* Non-standard framework proposed
* Non-standard state management proposed
* Non-standard authentication approach proposed
* Multiple design systems proposed
* Accessibility requirements are unclear
* Localization requirements are unclear
* Package manager deviates from Bun without ADR
* React or Next.js version deviates from approved versions without ADR
* Architectural pattern selection is unclear or contested
* Configuration-driven component contract is undefined
* Plugin/Registry or Strategy pattern contracts are missing

---

# Final Rule

Frontend technology choices must be:

* Requirement-driven
* Justified
* Traceable
* Documented

Frontend technology choices must never be based solely on:

* Personal preference
* Familiarity
* Popularity
* Trends
